  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "🍳 BigFood · AI 冰箱管家",
      "text": "上传食材图片识别 → 推荐菜谱。支持多图混搭、冰箱食材管理、采购提醒。Food recognition, recipe recommendation, ingredient management.\n\n> English: AI fridge manager: recognize ingredients from photos, recommend recipes, manage inventory."
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ 功能",
      "text": "详见 [SKILL.md](SKILL.md) 完整说明。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔧 环境依赖",
      "text": "食材识别需要多模态模型支持（上传图片分析）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "📥 安装（DeepSeek Harness / dsh）",
      "text": "本技能遵循 **Agent Skills 开放标准**（SKILL.md + YAML frontmatter），适用于 DeepSeek Harness (dsh)、OpenClaw、Claude Code 等支持 Agent Skills 的框架。\n\n```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：放入用户级共享目录（推荐）",
      "text": "mkdir -p ~/.agents\ngit clone https://github.com/kobenfang/bigfood.git ~/.agents/bigfood"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：放入项目目录",
      "text": "mkdir -p .agents\ncp -r bigfood .agents/\n```\n\ndsh 启动后即可在技能列表中找到 `bigfood`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔍 搜索关键词",
